issuecomment-32698742","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/938","id":32698742,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMyNjk4NzQy","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-01-19T01:40:28Z","updated_at":"2014-01-19T01:40:28Z","body":"I created a set and widgets and helpers for tabular data. A line from a relational model is loaded via AJAX. And in this case we report the city, and to select the city I use the widget I mentioned above. The problem is that the widget logs the JS POS_READY. I modifying the View component to force POS_END when the request is via AJAX solves my problem. Leave a script in the main view, for example, that whenever ajax append the result, calling the \"jQuery(\"#id-element\").select2(...\" would be another solution, but I believe there loses some sense of the widget.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/32698742/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ghost","id":